Part 4 session recording
========================

This workspace was inspected on 2026-11-06, but Docker, kind, kubectl, Helm,
and a WSL distribution were unavailable. No cluster commands were run and no
cluster output is fabricated here.

The chart evidence and fixes are documented in FINDINGS.md. On a provisioned
Linux machine, start the required real recording with:

  script -q part4-session.log
  ./scenario.sh reset
  ./scenario.sh up
  kubectl -n debug-lab get pods
  kubectl -n debug-lab describe pods
  ./scenario.sh verify
